                          Send Test Notification
                        </button>
                        <div className="p-4 bg-amber-100/50 rounded-xl border border-amber-200 text-[10px] text-amber-900 leading-relaxed">
                          <p className="font-bold uppercase mb-1">📱 Important for Mobile Users:</p>
                          To receive alerts when the app is closed:
                          <ol className="list-decimal ml-4 mt-1">
                            <li>Tap the 'Share' icon in your browser.</li>
                            <li>Select <strong>'Add to Home Screen'</strong>.</li>
                            <li>Open the installed app and enable alerts again.</li>
                          </ol>
                        </div>
